 "text": {
  "title": "Starved Bastion",
  "body": "Highgate Bastion—guarding the landward approach to Harborwatch—has been cut off for three weeks while its defenders boil boot-leather for broth. Cut both enemy supply escorts on the valley flanks, recover the iron-plated grain wagons, and break the Redoubt Commander.",
  "obj.0": "Cut both valley supply escorts",
  "obj.1": "Break the Valley Redoubt garrison and commander",
  "msg.1": "Highgate's defenders have boiled their own boot-leather for broth while siege engines pound the parapet. Cut both flank supply columns first, reclaim the grain wagons, then storm the redoubt!",
  "msg.1.who": "Scout Corin",
  "msg.2": "Both enemy supply columns lie broken in the ravine; our scouts recover the iron-plated grain wagons and a ration coffer holding six hundred coins!",
  "msg.2.who": "Scout Corin",
  "msg.3": "The Redoubt Commander falls! Green signal flares ignite above Highgate—the grain rolls through and Harborwatch's outer ring is secure!",
  "msg.3.who": "Scout Corin",
  "win": "Highgate Bastion is relieved with grain and steel, securing Harborwatch's outer ring.",
  "fail.1": "Your hero fell below Highgate Bastion."
 },
